<title>USA: TABLE - Amerada Hess Corp Q2 net drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Amerada Hess Corp Q2 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $4.04</p>
<p> Net			 41,700		  376,400</p>
<p> Revs		   1,878,800		2,543,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  92,300		   93,100</p>
<p>		     First Half</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.50		    $4.75</p>
<p> Net			 46,200		  442,400</p>
<p> Revs		   4,294,900		4,776,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  92,600		   93,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net includes gains on asset sales of $10.7 million, or $0.12/shr, and $350.1 million, or $3.76/shr, in the second quarter and first half of 1997 and 1996, respectively.</p>
<p>Analysts consensus for the quarter was $0.18 per share, according to First Call.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
